/-
# Fibre finiteness of the third chart piece c2 = D(hRev) of hPoly

Consumer: B1 (andrew's Mzk1G1PhiFiberFiniteFixedActual), which needs the fibre of
phi over a value to be finite.  This file supplies the ring-level input for the third
piece of the hPoly cover (Mzk1G1PsiHPolyActual.hPolyChart2, the chart D(hRev) inside
the lambda chart, with coordinate hPolyLam h = lambda^d / hRev(lambda)).

The mathematical content is the standard "a nonzero polynomial has finite fibres under
the polynomial map": for a value c, the fibre of lambda |-> lambda^d / hRev(lambda)
over c is cut out by the equation

    lambda^d - c * hRev(lambda) = 0,

which is a nonzero polynomial in lambda as soon as h is nonconstant (for constant h
the polynomial X^0 - c * hRev h can be the zero polynomial, see the remark below).

Results:

1. hRev_coeff_zero, hRev_ne_zero: hRev h has constant coefficient h.leadingCoeff,
   hence is nonzero when h is.
2. hPolyLam_sub_eq: in Localization.Away (hRev h) the difference hPolyLam h - c
   differs from the image of X^d - C c * hRev h by a unit.  This is the standard
   identity X^d = hPolyLam * hRev together with invertibility of hRev in Away (hRev).
3. c2Poly_ne_zero, c2Quotient_finite: X^d - C c * hRev h is nonzero and the quotient
   Q[X]/(X^d - C c * hRev h) is finite-dimensional over Q (reusing
   Mzk1G1PsiQuotientFiniteActual.quotient_poly_finite).
4. finite_primes_of_hPolyLam (the consumer-facing statement): the set of primes of
   Localization.Away (hRev h) containing hPolyLam h - c is finite.  Route: by 2 the
   ideal generated by hPolyLam h - c equals the ideal generated by the image of
   X^d - C c * hRev h; the latter primes are pullbacks (along the localization map) of
   primes of Q[X] containing X^d - C c * hRev h, a finite set by 3 and
   Mzk1G1PsiFiberFiniteActual.finite_primes_of_finite_quotient; the pullback map is
   injective on prime spectra of a localization by IsLocalization.map_under, so
   Set.Finite.of_injOn applies.

Remark on the degree hypothesis 1 <= h.natDegree (it is essential, not cosmetic): for
h = C a (nonzero constant) we have hRev h = C a and X^0 - C c * hRev h = 1 - C (c * a),
which vanishes for c = a^-1.  Then the quotient in 3 is Q[X] itself (not
finite-dimensional), and the final fibre statement 4 is false as well: C a is a unit of
Q[X], so Localization.Away (C a) is (isomorphic to) Q[X] itself, and
hPolyLam h = invSelf (C a) = C a^-1 is a constant, so for c = a^-1 every prime of
Spec (Localization.Away (C a)) contains hPolyLam h - c.  Hence B1 must apply this file
to a nonconstant h (as it does).

Degraded item (documented, not needed by the final theorem): the general lemma
finite_away_of_finite : Module.Finite Q A -> Module.Finite Q (Localization.Away f) is
true (a finite-dimensional Q-algebra is Artinian, and for Artinian A the localization
map A -> A_f is surjective because the chain f^n A stabilizes, so A_f is a quotient of
A; equivalently f^-1 is integral over Q via the reverse of a monic relation for f, and
A_f is a finite type Q-algebra, so finiteness follows from integrality + finite type).
This file does not formalize it, because the final theorem below is proved directly at
the level of prime spectra and does not need it.  The honest dependency set of item 4 is
items 2, 3, Set.Finite.of_injOn and IsLocalization.map_under.

No sorry, no new axioms, no toy carriers.
-/
import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.Mzk1G1PsiHPolyActual
import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.Mzk1G1PsiFiberFiniteActual
import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.Mzk1G1PsiQuotientFiniteActual
import Mathlib.Tactic

noncomputable section
set_option relaxedAutoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 1600000

namespace LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.Mzk1G1PsiFiberFiniteC2Actual

open Polynomial
open LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.Mzk1G1PsiHPolyActual
open LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.Mzk1G1PsiFiberFiniteActual
open LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.Mzk1G1PsiQuotientFiniteActual

/-! ## 1. Basic facts about the reversed polynomial hRev -/

/-- The constant coefficient of hRev h is the leading coefficient of h. -/
theorem hRev_coeff_zero (h : Polynomial ℚ) (hh : h ≠ 0) :
    (hRev h).coeff 0 = h.leadingCoeff := by
  have hdmem : h.natDegree ∈ h.support := by
    rw [Polynomial.mem_support_iff]
    show h.leadingCoeff ≠ 0
    exact Polynomial.leadingCoeff_ne_zero.mpr hh
  rw [hRev, Polynomial.finsetSum_coeff,
    Finset.sum_eq_single_of_mem h.natDegree hdmem]
  · rw [Polynomial.coeff_C_mul, Polynomial.coeff_X_pow, Nat.sub_self, if_pos rfl, mul_one]
    rfl
  · intro i hi hne
    rw [Polynomial.coeff_C_mul, Polynomial.coeff_X_pow]
    have hi_le : i ≤ h.natDegree := Polynomial.le_natDegree_of_mem_supp i hi
    rw [if_neg (by omega), mul_zero]

/-- hRev h is nonzero when h is nonzero (its constant coefficient is h.leadingCoeff). -/
theorem hRev_ne_zero (h : Polynomial ℚ) (hh : h ≠ 0) : hRev h ≠ 0 := by
  intro hzero
  have hc := hRev_coeff_zero h hh
  rw [hzero] at hc
  have hc0 : h.leadingCoeff = 0 := by simpa using hc.symm
  exact hh (Polynomial.leadingCoeff_eq_zero.mp hc0)

#print axioms hRev_coeff_zero
#print axioms hRev_ne_zero

/-! ## 2. The unit identity for hPolyLam h - c -/

/-- In Localization.Away (hRev h), the difference hPolyLam h - c is a unit multiple of
the image of X^d - C c * hRev h.  Both sides vanish on the same primes. -/
theorem hPolyLam_sub_eq (h : Polynomial ℚ) (c : ℚ) :
    ∃ u : (Localization.Away (hRev h))ˣ,
      hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c =
        (u : Localization.Away (hRev h)) *
          algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
            (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h) := by
  classical
  let H : Localization.Away (hRev h) :=
    algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) (hRev h)
  have hHmul : H * IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) = 1 := by
    simpa [H] using (IsLocalization.Away.mul_invSelf (x := hRev h))
  let uH : (Localization.Away (hRev h))ˣ :=
    { val := IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h)
      inv := H
      val_inv := by
        rw [mul_comm (IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h)) H]
        exact hHmul
      inv_val := hHmul }
  refine ⟨uH, ?_⟩
  show hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c =
    IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) *
      algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
        (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h)
  have hC : algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) (Polynomial.C c) =
      algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c := by
    rw [Polynomial.C_eq_algebraMap,
      ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply ℚ (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c]
  have hY : hPolyLam h * H =
      (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) Polynomial.X) ^ h.natDegree := by
    rw [hPolyLam]
    rw [mul_assoc, mul_comm (IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h)) H, hHmul, mul_one]
  have hG : algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
      (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h) =
      (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) Polynomial.X) ^ h.natDegree -
        algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c * H := by
    rw [map_sub, map_pow, map_mul, hC]
  calc hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c
      = (hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c) * 1 :=
        (mul_one _).symm
    _ = (hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c) *
          (H * IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h)) := by
        rw [hHmul, mul_one]
    _ = ((hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c) * H) *
          IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) := by ring
    _ = ((hPolyLam h * H - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c * H)) *
          IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) := by ring
    _ = ((algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) Polynomial.X) ^ h.natDegree -
          algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c * H) *
          IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) := by rw [hY]
    _ = IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) *
          ((algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)) Polynomial.X) ^ h.natDegree -
            algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c * H) := by ring
    _ = IsLocalization.Away.invSelf (x := hRev h) *
          algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
            (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h) := by rw [← hG]

#print axioms hPolyLam_sub_eq

/-! ## 3. Nonvanishing and finite-dimensionality of Q[X]/(X^d - C c * hRev h) -/

/-- For nonconstant h, the polynomial X^d - C c * hRev h is nonzero: for c = 0 it is
the monic polynomial X^d, and for c ≠ 0 its constant coefficient is
-c * h.leadingCoeff ≠ 0. -/
theorem c2Poly_ne_zero (h : Polynomial ℚ) (hh : h ≠ 0) (hd : 1 ≤ h.natDegree) (c : ℚ) :
    Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h ≠ 0 := by
  rcases eq_or_ne c 0 with hc | hc
  · subst hc
    simpa using (Polynomial.monic_X_pow (R := ℚ) (n := h.natDegree)).ne_zero
  · intro hzero
    have hcoeff : (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h).coeff 0 =
        -(c * h.leadingCoeff) := by
      rw [Polynomial.coeff_sub, Polynomial.coeff_C_mul, hRev_coeff_zero h hh,
        Polynomial.coeff_X_pow, if_neg (by omega), zero_sub]
    have hne : (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h).coeff 0 ≠ 0 := by
      rw [hcoeff]
      exact neg_ne_zero.mpr (mul_ne_zero hc (Polynomial.leadingCoeff_ne_zero.mpr hh))
    exact hne (by rw [hzero]; simp)

/-- The quotient Q[X]/(X^d - C c * hRev h) is finite-dimensional over Q. -/
theorem c2Quotient_finite (h : Polynomial ℚ) (hh : h ≠ 0) (hd : 1 ≤ h.natDegree) (c : ℚ) :
    Module.Finite ℚ (Polynomial ℚ ⧸
      Ideal.span ({Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h} : Set (Polynomial ℚ))) :=
  quotient_poly_finite _ (c2Poly_ne_zero h hh hd c)

#print axioms c2Poly_ne_zero
#print axioms c2Quotient_finite

/-! ## 4. Finitely many primes of Away (hRev h) containing hPolyLam h - c -/

/-- The fibre of the third chart coordinate hPolyLam h over c is finite: only finitely
many primes of Localization.Away (hRev h) contain hPolyLam h - algebraMap Q _ c. -/
theorem finite_primes_of_hPolyLam (h : Polynomial ℚ) (hh : h ≠ 0) (hd : 1 ≤ h.natDegree)
    (c : ℚ) :
    {P : PrimeSpectrum (Localization.Away (hRev h)) |
      (hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c) ∈ P.asIdeal}.Finite := by
  classical
  obtain ⟨u, hu⟩ := hPolyLam_sub_eq h c
  have hT : {p : PrimeSpectrum (Polynomial ℚ) |
      (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h) ∈ p.asIdeal}.Finite :=
    finite_primes_of_finite_quotient
      (f := Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h)
      (c2Quotient_finite h hh hd c)
  have hmem : ∀ P : PrimeSpectrum (Localization.Away (hRev h)),
      (hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c) ∈ P.asIdeal ↔
      algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
        (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h) ∈ P.asIdeal := by
    intro P
    constructor
    · intro hP
      have h1 : (((u⁻¹ : (Localization.Away (hRev h))ˣ) :
            Localization.Away (hRev h))) *
          (hPolyLam h - algebraMap ℚ (Localization.Away (hRev h)) c) ∈ P.asIdeal :=
        P.asIdeal.mul_mem_left _ hP
      rw [hu] at h1
      have h2 : (((u⁻¹ : (Localization.Away (hRev h))ˣ) :
            Localization.Away (hRev h))) *
          ((u : Localization.Away (hRev h)) *
            algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
              (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h)) =
          algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))
            (Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h) := by
        rw [← mul_assoc, ← Units.val_mul, inv_mul_cancel, Units.val_one, one_mul]
      rwa [h2] at h1
    · intro hP
      rw [hu]
      exact P.asIdeal.mul_mem_left _ hP
  refine Set.Finite.of_injOn (f := PrimeSpectrum.comap
    (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h)))) ?_ ?_ hT
  · intro P hP
    show Polynomial.X ^ h.natDegree - Polynomial.C c * hRev h ∈
      (PrimeSpectrum.comap (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))) P).asIdeal
    rw [PrimeSpectrum.comap_asIdeal, Ideal.mem_comap]
    exact (hmem P).mp hP
  · intro P _ Q _ hPQ
    apply PrimeSpectrum.ext
    have hunder : P.asIdeal.under (Polynomial ℚ) = Q.asIdeal.under (Polynomial ℚ) := by
      simpa using congrArg PrimeSpectrum.asIdeal hPQ
    have hPmap : (P.asIdeal.under (Polynomial ℚ)).map
        (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))) = P.asIdeal :=
      IsLocalization.map_under (Submonoid.powers (hRev h))
        (Localization.Away (hRev h)) P.asIdeal
    have hQmap : (Q.asIdeal.under (Polynomial ℚ)).map
        (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))) = Q.asIdeal :=
      IsLocalization.map_under (Submonoid.powers (hRev h))
        (Localization.Away (hRev h)) Q.asIdeal
    calc P.asIdeal
        = (P.asIdeal.under (Polynomial ℚ)).map
            (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))) := hPmap.symm
      _ = (Q.asIdeal.under (Polynomial ℚ)).map
            (algebraMap (Polynomial ℚ) (Localization.Away (hRev h))) := by rw [hunder]
      _ = Q.asIdeal := hQmap

#print axioms finite_primes_of_hPolyLam

end LeanFormal.IUT.XiFPaper.Mzk1G1PsiFiberFiniteC2Actual
